街区レベル位置参照情報 国土交通省 (MLIT, Ministry of Land, Infrastructure, Transport and Tourism,
Japan), 2025年度版, version 24.0a: the 47 prefectural archives (01000-24.0a.zip through
47000-24.0a.zip), captured 2026-10-31. Source: https://nlftp.mlit.go.jp/isj/.
Their URLs, byte sizes and SHA-256 checksums are recorded in tests/registry/jp.sources.tsv.

The corpus tests/registry/jp.jsonl was sampled and reformatted by OpenGeocoding from this source.
It decodes Shift-JIS to UTF-8, keeps current representative residential-address blocks with
numeric block signs, transforms JGD2000 geographic coordinates to WGS84, draws a seeded sample,
and constructs query forms from the source's names and block signs. These edits and queries are
not unmodified MLIT publications and are not endorsed by MLIT. Points represent blocks, not
individual residences or entrances.

Used under the 位置参照情報利用約款 (Location Reference Information Terms of Use, revised
2013-02-07), https://nlftp.mlit.go.jp/isj/agreement.html: free use, including reproduction,
citation and edited outputs, with the required source credit above and, where possible, edition,
